stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Ready
    Ready --> Pending: Open filing editor
    Pending --> Editing: Deal read succeeds
    Pending --> Unavailable: Network failure
    Unavailable --> Ready: Cancel
    Editing --> Ready: Cancel
    Editing --> Previewing: Review selected deal
    Previewing --> Preview: Exact target accepted
    Previewing --> Recovery: Preview refused
    Recovery --> Ready: Refresh and review
    Preview --> Saving: Confirm
    Saving --> Recovery: Outcome unknown
    Recovery --> Saving: Check outcome with original request
    Saving --> Done: Matching receipt
    Ready --> NewEditing: Open new deal
    NewEditing --> Creating: Submit new deal
    Creating --> Previewing: Deal created
    Creating --> Recovery: Creation outcome unknown
    Recovery --> Creating: Check creation outcome
    Preview --> Created: Cancel created filing
    Previewing --> Created: Created filing preview fails
    Created --> Previewing: Review created deal
    Pending --> Retired: Authorization lost
    Previewing --> Retired: Authorization lost
    Saving --> Retired: Authorization lost
    Creating --> Retired: Authorization lost
    Retired --> Retired: Late result or retained event
    Pending --> Disposed: Parent removes editor
    Disposed --> Disposed: Late result or retained event
    %% never Retired exposes edit controls or accepts a write.
    %% never Disposed accepts a late result.
